{"id":"techo","lemma":"techo","pos":"noun","rank":1313,"glosses":["ceiling","roof"],"ipa":"/ˈtet͡ʃo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"techos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-techo.wav","formAudio":{"techos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-techos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Él es un sin techo.","en":"He is homeless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703742"},{"text":"La blanca nieve cubrió los rojos techos.","en":"The white snow covered the red roofs."},{"text":"Hay goteras en el techo.","en":"The roof is leaking.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586391"},{"text":"El techo está en llamas.","en":"The roof is on fire.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/419340"},{"text":"Él colgó una lámpara del techo.","en":"He put a light on the roof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64573"}]}